// What asks for a memory on the coast (bible 10, docs/design/offerings.md; `Offerings`). A given memory is gone for
// good; if its place is anchored, the seal loosens a stage. The offer command gives it; can_offer(asker, memory)
// and offered(asker) ask.

title: Chapel_Door
---
<<if offered("chapel_door")>>
    Door: Open. The reliquary behind it is empty now, and dry. #still #line:099e11a
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Door: Salt-eaten paper behind the altar, cut with one line: "Sing me in." #still #line:02032f7
<<if not can_offer("chapel_door", "dotha.nine_songs")>>
    Door: It waits. Nobody on this coast sings any more. Nearly nobody. #still #line:04b66c0
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if place_fate("Saltmarrow_B") == "anchored">>
    Door: The songs are sealed into Merrow's End. The door doesn't care. #still #line:070e4ba
<<endif>>
-> Weather first. Then the rest. #line:0f11ec6
    <<voice surveyor saltmarrow>>
    <<offer chapel_door dotha.nine_songs>>
    Door: The paper takes the songs, weather first. It opens like a page turning. #line:0e5e53e
    Door: Behind it, the reliquary: two scraps of good vellum, and nothing else. #line:0243a46
-> Not these. They're Dotha's. #line:09b2a06
    <<voice warden saltmarrow>>
    Door: It waits. Doors are patient on this coast. #still #line:091e6ff
-> ... #line:058c806
    <<voice drift saltmarrow>>
    Door: Salt settles on the line. It can wait. #still #line:0780568
===

title: Chain_Gannet
---
<<if offered("chain_gannet")>>
    Gannet: Eleven hundred and six. I tell the water. It likes a number. #still #face:grave #line:07f1968
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Gannet: Have you eaten? Good. The boats go out every morning. Who comes back? #still #line:0db1151
-> Eleven hundred and six. Sable counted. <<if can_offer("chain_gannet", "sable.boats_back")>> #line:052deca
    <<voice surveyor saltmarrow>>
    <<offer chain_gannet sable.boats_back>>
    Gannet: Eleven hundred and six. More than I thought. Fewer than go. #face:grave #line:071f692
    Gannet: Seed, for the number. I kept it for whoever knew. #line:0160e93
-> I don't know. #line:08991ed
    <<voice warden saltmarrow>>
    Gannet: Nobody knows. Ask the one who names the prices. #still #face:grave #line:0e4fbc1
-> ... #line:01f5cba
    <<voice drift saltmarrow>>
    Gannet: Quiet. They are quiet too, going out. #still #face:grave #line:05cca27
===
